{
  "name": "dbus-rust",
  "description": "A low-level Foreign Function Interface (FFI) wrapper providing Rust bindings for the libdbus-1 C library. The project implements core DBus abstractions including connection management, error handling, and message dispatching status, aimed at enabling inter-process communication within Rust applications. It features ergonomic type definitions for DBus interfaces, methods, and signals while interfacing directly with native system-bus components.",
